-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MODEL LICENSE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The included pre-trained U-Net model (crack_unet.onnx and best_model.pth) is
the exclusive intellectual property of AIhdproduction. The model was trained
on a proprietary dataset of 124,796 annotated crack images which is not
publicly available and will not be released.

The model may be used freely under the non-commercial terms of this license.
This includes running inference locally and using it as a starting point for
fine-tuning on your own data (transfer learning).

The PyTorch checkpoint (best_model.pth) is not included in this repository by
default. If you need it for fine-tuning purposes, you may request it here:
  GitHub: https://github.com/AIhdproduction/CrackDetect/issues

Requests will be reviewed individually. The checkpoint will only be shared for
non-commercial research, education, or personal fine-tuning purposes.

